<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef generally firm on light to moderate demand and offerings. Select and Choice chuck, round and rib cuts firm, while loin cuts uneven. Beef trimmings steady to firm on light to moderate demand and offerings. -USDA</p>
